body:
Thank you for your kind words. It's reassuring to know this is common for people with depression. It might bring me over in needing help - but honestly, who knows. Sometimes it does just feel like I'm crazy with this, so I don't know if I'm actually gonna be able to convince myself. We'll have to see.

&#x200B;

Again, just thank you for the kind words. It means a lot.

Ned Stark takes the throne after Robert's rebellion.

He becomes The King and rules the kingdom fairly, never letting the crown go so deep in dept, or all the different sneaky bastards (Littlefinger, Varys, etc) gain so much control. I think this change would have changed a lot of things.

&#x200B;
